# ISB MBA Knowledge System

This is a skill group containing 9 MBA domain skills. Each skill has:
- `SKILL.md` — compact router with priority table
- `rules/_sections.md` — full index of all rule files
- `rules/*.md` — individual concept files with YAML frontmatter

## Workflow
1. Route query to correct domain skill(s)
2. Scan SKILL.md for relevant sections
3. Load specific rule files as needed
4. For cross-domain questions, also check mba-tutor/
